    "media:imagetext": "THIS SUMMER...\nPORTLAND\nPacific Air Lines will fly\nBoeing 727 jets to San Jose,\nBakersfield, Fresno, Santa Barbara,\nMonterey, Reno, Lake Tahoe,\nSan Francisco and\nCRESCENT\nCITY\nEUREKA-\nARCATA\nLos Angeles.\nMEDFORD\nREDDING -\nRED BLUFF\nCHICO\nMARYSVILLE\nYUBA CITY\nSANTA ROSA\nRENO\nLAKE TAHOE\nSAN FRANCISCO\nOAKLAND\nSACRAMENTO\nSTOCKTON\nSAN JOSE\nвовне 727\nMONTEREY\n- SALINAS\nSAN LUIS OBISPO\n— PASO ROBLES\nSANTA MARIA\nVANDENBERG A. F. B.\nSANTA BARBARA\nOXNARD - VENTURA\nFRESNO\nBAKERSFIELD\nLAS VEGAS\nINYOKERN\nPALMDALE -\nLANCASTER\nLOS ANGELES\nLONG BEACH\nBURBANK\nSAN DIEGO\nWe fly to the nicest places.\nAsk your travel agent or Pacific Air Lines for a free\nbrochure on our 16 Pacific Wonderland Holidays.",
